The <ansi fg="command">earnmutation</ansi> command is a playtest lever for the
mutation system.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Usage:</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">earnmutation [player]</ansi>
  Spends one earned mutation event for the player (yourself
  if none is named), through the same code a fight runs. It
  deepens or acquires a mutation under every rule, including
  the Conviction reserve budget. If nothing fits, it says so
  and the player keeps their progress.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - The player must be online.
  - With no arguments, it acts on you.
